It is winter, and it is dark outside.
I am sitting in my apartment in Copenhagen.
I want to be more active in the winter.
I decide to do sports again.
I open my computer.
I look on the internet.
What can I do here in the city?
I really like to play badminton.
It is a very fun sport.
I try to find a local club.
I search for badminton in Copenhagen.
I find a large sports hall.
The hall is located close to my apartment.
I can take the bus there in ten minutes.
The club has room for new players.
You can come and play tonight.
My own racket is at home in Mexico.
But I can rent a racket at the hall.
That sounds absolutely perfect.
I close the computer and pack my bag.
